OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA wet
OL,6,Fevening across the country. Some snow
OL,7,Fmay also fall over northern hills for
OL,8,Fa time. Turning windy, with gales
OL,9,Fpossible over hills and towards the
OL,10,Fcoasts. Staying wet overnight, with
OL,11,Ffurther spells of heavy rain moving
OL,12,Fthrough.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FA wet start on Tuesday with
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain, sometimes heavy.
OL,16,FTurning drier through the afternoon
OL,17,Fwith sunny spells developing with
OL,18,Fheavy showers. A milder day, but
OL,19,Frather breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
